# Build outputs — the deliverable tar.gz carries these, not the repo.
dist/
results.json
results.md

# Contestant build trees
build/
**/build/
**/node_modules/
**/.gradle/
**/target/
**/.cxx/
**/DerivedData/
# Rust .so staging copied in by `water build` — regenerated on each build.
**/jniLibs/
# Lockfiles (Cargo.lock, Water.lock, package-lock) stay tracked — they are the pin record.
# flutter/gradle generated trees
**/android/.cxx/
**/android/app/.cxx/
**/local.properties
**/gradlew
**/gradlew.bat
**/gradle-wrapper.jar
*.iml
.idea/
.metadata
.packages
.flutter-plugins*
.dart_tool/
!**/pubspec.lock
**/*.keystore  # debug.keystore included — keytool regenerates it at build
# runner-owned caches: provisioned water CLI, verified gradle dists, bundletool
.cache/
traces/
